      "section_code": "thesis",
      "section_title": "Sector Synthesis & Thesis",
      "content": "The Indian Cables & Wires Sector is benefiting from a structural multi-decade capex super-cycle across\npower distribution grid upgrades, renewable energy evacuation, high-speed rail, and real estate construction\n. Organized players continue to gain market share from unorganized regional producers as compliance, NABL accreditation, and brand trust take priority.\nMarket leaders with\nEHV technology capabilities and global export reach\n(Polycab, Apar, KEI) possess strong pricing power, permitting 100% pass-through of copper price inflation while generating industry-leading ROCEs (>25%).",
      "source_locator": "cables-wires-q1fy27-sector-review.html#.synth"
    }
  ],
